<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>The Fall of Natanim | Documentary</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-color: #0b0c10;
      --card-bg: #1f2833;
      --text-main: #edf5e1;
      --accent-glow: #ff2a6d;
      --secondary-glow: #05d9e8;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-color);
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 20px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 800px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    /* Hero Section with Glowing Text */
    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 60px 20px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      color: #fff;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent-glow), 0 0 20px var(--accent-glow), 0 0 40px var(--accent-glow);
      animation: pulseGlow 3s infinite alternate;
    }

    .tagline {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--secondary-glow);
      margin-top: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    /* Documentary Chapters */
    .chapter {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    /* Custom Scale & Glow Animation on Hover */
    .chapter:hover {
      transform: scale(1.03);
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(5, 217, 232, 0.4);
      border-color: var(--secondary-glow);
    }

    .chapter-number {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent-glow);
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .chapter h2 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      color: #fff;
    }

    /* Keyframe Animations */
    @keyframes pulseGlow {
      0% {
        text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent-glow), 0 0 20px var(--accent-glow);
      }
      100% {
        text-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--accent-glow), 0 0 35px var(--accent-glow), 0 0 50px var(--accent-glow);
      }
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 0;
      color: #666;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>Natanim</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Truth, Identity, and the Collapse</p>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="chapter">
        <div class="chapter-number">Chapter I</div>
        <h2>The Revelation</h2>
        <p>
          Behind closed doors, Natanim lived a dual life. When he finally came out and embraced his true identity as a gay man, it shattered the false narrative he had constructed for years, throwing his circle into immediate turbulence.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="chapter">
        <div class="chapter-number">Chapter II</div>
        <h2>The Fallout</h2>
        <p>
          Authenticity came at a high cost. As secrets unravelled, key alliances crumbled. Internal conflicts within his team quickly escalated into public disputes, setting off an unstoppable chain reaction.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="chapter">
        <div class="chapter-number">Chapter III</div>
        <h2>The Downfall</h2>
        <p>
          Miscalculations and betrayal sealed his fate. What took years to build collapsed in a matter of weeks, leaving behind only the wreckage of a once-promising legacy and a cautionary tale of unchecked ambition.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>&copy; 2026 Mini-Documentary Archives. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </footer>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
